DESCRIPTION:Artist Curtis Patterson and Curator of Exhibition Melissa Messi
 na will lead a tour of the exhibition.\n\nExperience Persistent Vision thr
 ough the perspectives of artist Curtis Patterson and curator Melissa Messi
 na. Together\, they’ll guide visitors through the exhibition\, offering 
 insights into Patterson’s artistic practice\, the ideas and inspirations
  behind the work\, and the stories that connect the pieces. Hear directly 
 from the artist and curator as they explore the exhibition’s themes\, cr
 eative processes\, and the ways art invites us to look back\, look forward
 \, and see familiar ideas in new ways.\n\nAn engaging opportunity to exper
 ience Persistent Vision through the voices of the people who know it best.
